#. Tag: title
#: video-encoding.docbook:2
#, no-c-format
msgid "How to rip a DVD and encode it into an MPEG-4 AVI with &k3b;"
msgstr "តើត្រូវ​​បម្លែងឌីវីឌី​ ហើយ​អ៊ិនកូដ​វា​ទៅ​ជា​ MPEG-4 AVI ប្រើ​ k3b ដោយ​របៀប​ណា"

#. Tag: title
#: video-encoding.docbook:6
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "ការណែនាំ​"

#. Tag: para
#: video-encoding.docbook:7
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This document is a description for the DVD ripping and video encoding feature "
"of &k3b;. The document describes the single steps to backup a DVD to the "
"harddisk and to encode it to an MPEG-4 compliant AVI."
msgstr ""
"ឯកសារ​នេះជាការណែ​នាំ​ការបម្លែងឌីវីឌី​ និង​ការអ៊ិនកូដវីដេអូ​នៃ​លក្ខណៈពិសេស​របស់​ "
"k3b ។ ឯកសារ​ណែនាំ​តែ​មួយ​ជំហាន​សម្រាប់​បម្រុង​ទុក​ឌីវីឌី​ទៅ​កាន់​ថាសរឹង​ "
"និង​ដើម្បី​អ៊ិនកូដវា​ទៅជា MPEG-4 ឬ AVI ។​"

#. Tag: para
#: video-encoding.docbook:11
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&k3b; is only the frontend for these steps. For ripping and encoding the "
"&Linux; video stream processing tool <application>transcode</application> "
"is used."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: video-encoding.docbook:17
#, no-c-format
msgid "Dependencies"
msgstr "ដែល​អាច​ទុកចិត្ត​បាន​"

#. Tag: para
#: video-encoding.docbook:18
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<application>transcode</application> version 0.6.0pre5 and its <ulink "
"url=\"http://www.theorie.physik.uni-goettingen.de/~ostreich/transcode/\">"
"dependencies</ulink> a MPEG-4 encoder; either <ulink "
"url=\"http://www.xvid.org\">Xvid</ulink> or <ulink url=\"http://www.divx.com\">"
"DivX4/5</ulink>, libdvdread (tested with version 0.9.2, <ulink "
"url=\"http://www.dtek.chalmers.se/groups/dvd/\">www.dtek.chalmers.se/groups/dvd/"
"</ulink>)."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: video-encoding.docbook:27
#, no-c-format
msgid "Ripping the DVD"
msgstr "ការបម្លែង​ឌីវីឌី "

#. Tag: para
#: video-encoding.docbook:28
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"First step is to choose the title/movie you want to rip. For this click on the "
"drive icon of your DVD-Drive. You will now see a list that shows the content of "
"the DVD with all movie sequence. The longest movie sequence (usually the main "
"movie) is automatically selected. Right click on the title and choose copy."
msgstr ""
"ជំហាន​ដំបូង​ត្រូវ​ជ្រើស​ចំណង​ជើង​ខ្សែភាពយន្ត​ដែល​អ្នក​ចង់​បម្លែង​ ។ ចុច​លើ​រូបតំណាង​ដ្រាយ​នៃ​ដ្រាយ​ឌីវីឌី​របស់​អ្នក​ ។ ឥឡូវ​នេះ​អ្នកនឹង​ឃើញ​បញ្ជី​បង្ហាញ​មាតិកា​នៃ​ឌីវីឌី​ដែល​មាន​ខ្សែ "
"ភាព​យន្តទាំងអស់​ជា​បន្តបន្ទាប់​ ។ ខ្សែភាព​យន្ត​ដែល​វែងជាងគេ​ "
"(ជា​ធម្មតា​ប្រើ​ខ្សែភាព​យន្ត​មេ​) ត្រូវ​បាន​ជ្រើស​ដោយ​ស្វ័យប្រវត្តិ​ ។ ចុច​កណ្តុរ​ស្តាំ​លើ​ចំណង​ជើង​ ហើយ​ជ្រើស​ចម្លង​ ។​"

#. Tag: para
#: video-encoding.docbook:34
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the following dialog enter the destination directory in the first line. The "
"second and third will be filled out automatically. Don't change these paths."
msgstr ""
"នៅ​ក្នុង​ប្រអប់​ខាងក្រោម​នេះ​បញ្ចូល​ថត​ទិសដៅ​នៅ​បន្ទាត់​ដំបូង​គេ​ ។ ហើយ​បន្ទាត់​"
"ទី​ពីរ​ និង​ទីបី​វា​នឹង​បំពេញ​ដោយ​ស្វ័យប្រវត្តិ​ ។ កុំ​ផ្លាស់ប្តូរ​ផ្លូវ​ទាំង​នេះ ។​"

#. Tag: para
#: video-encoding.docbook:38
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Now press start and wait until the ripping has been finished. You should now "
"have a directory which contains a project file (k3bDVDRip.xml), a vob directory "
"with the vob file (like vts_0x_y.vob) and tmp directory with the IFO files "
"(video_ts.ifo and one like vts_0x_0.ifo)"
msgstr ""
"ឥឡូវ​ចុច​ចាប់​ផ្តើម ហើយ​រងចាំ​រហូ​ត​ដល់​ការបម្លែង​ត្រូវ​បាន​បញ្ចប់​ ។ "
"អ្នក​គួរតែបង្កើត​​ថតដែល​មាន​ឯកសារ​គម្រោង​ (k3bDVDRip.xml) ថត​ vob "
"ដែល​មាន​ឯកសារ​ vob  (like vts_0x_y.vob) និង​ថត​ tmp មានឯកសារ​ IFO "
"(video_ts.ifo and one like vts_0x_0.ifo)"

#. Tag: title
#: video-encoding.docbook:47
#, no-c-format
msgid "Setting up the encoding"
msgstr "ការរៀប​ចំ​ការអ៊ិនកូដ "

#. Tag: para
#: video-encoding.docbook:48
#, no-c-format
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Open the encoding dialog in the menu Tools->Encode video. Now load the project "
"file from the DVD-Rip (k3bDVDRip.xml in your movie directory) and set a file "
"name for your final avi (movie.avi). You can now set the parameters for the "
"encoding. For a first test choose the amount of CDs your final avi should be "
"and the language you want it to have. The other settings can be left default."
msgstr ""
"បើក​ប្រអប់​ការអ៊ិនកូដ​ក្នុង​ម៉ឺនុយ ឧបករណ៍-> អ៊ិនកូដវីដេអ​Encode video. Now load the project "
"file from the DVD-Rip (k3bDVDRip.xml in your movie directory) and set a file "
"name for your final avi (movie.avi). You can now set the parameters for the "
"encoding. For a first test choose the amount of CDs your final avi should be "
"and the language you want it to have. The other settings can be left default."

#. Tag: para
#: video-encoding.docbook:55
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"(More information on each parameter and their choices is available as "
"<guimenuitem>What's This</guimenuitem> help, via right clicking the "
"corresponding GUI element). Change to the Advanced Audio/Video Settings tab "
"panel to set the final size of your movie. Here you can cut off black borders "
"and resize your movie to get a proper quality (We experienced good results with "
"a width of 640)."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: video-encoding.docbook:62
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Initializing of the preview could fail. So first click on the slider below the "
"preview to get a new picture. To the right of the preview choose the \"FAST\" "
"resizing method. This scaling can only handle pixel sizes which are a multipile "
"of 8, but is a lot faster than pixel \"EXACT\" resizing. You may also enable "
"auto-crop. (Auto-crop should work most times. If not first try another sample "
"image.)"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: video-encoding.docbook:65
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When changing the final size of your movie the \"VIDEO QUALITY\" should be "
"greater than 0.15 (at least for a single CD rip). Once again, see the \"What's "
"This\" help for detailed information. Now start encoding."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: video-encoding.docbook:72
#, no-c-format
msgid "Encoding process"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: video-encoding.docbook:73
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Encoding first scans the whole movie for the min/max level of the audio track. "
"The result is a gain level to boost/normalize the audio track. (This is "
"normally done by the AC3 decoder of your amplifier. This can't be done with the "
"final AVI because it contains a MP3 track.) After that the video and audio "
"track will be encoded and after a few hours you are able to watch your encoded "
"video with every DivX capable player (i.e mplayer, xine, aviplay and of course "
"each player based on M$ Systems)."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: video-encoding.docbook:79
#, no-c-format
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: video-encoding.docbook:80
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In general first see the debug output for further information. If this doesn't "
"help you find help on the k3b-users mailing list "
"(http://k3b.sourceforge.net/index.php?page=mailinglists.html). If you are using "
"DivX make sure you choose the codec version installed on your system. You "
"cannot install both versions on your linux box because both binaries are using "
"the same name. If you've trouble with the different installations search all "
"libdivxencore.so and libdivxdecore.so files and delete them. Install the "
"version you want and start encoding again. If aspect ratio detection fails "
"(your final movie is to high) set the height by hand after resizing and verify "
"the aspect ratio in the info box \"FINAL VIDEO\"."
msgstr ""

